cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use PPIIMoL, please cite this software and the reference article.
title: PPIIMoL
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2025-07-19
authors:
  - family-names: Rodríguez Fernández
    given-names: Silvia Enma
repository-code: https://github.com/silviaenma/PPIIMoL
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords: [PyMOL, polyproline II, PPII helices, protein structure]
abstract: >
  PPIIMoL is a Python module for PyMOL that automates the detection of polyproline II (PPII)
  helices, screens plausible Cα–H···O=C contacts, and provides one-click visualization and CSV export.
